{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_118","type":"agent_message","text":"The first load exposed four strong undefined trace hooks. In C these are weak optional imports and are null in the reference build; C2Rust lost the weak linkage and converted the null check into an always-true `Some`. I’m restoring the reference’s no-hook behavior directly in the translated modules, which removes those unresolved imports without adding four extra ABI symbols."}}
